136
00:12:34,230 --> 00:12:39,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But lately Father and nii-san
haven't been getting along so...</font>

137
00:12:42,610 --> 00:12:44,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was thinking...</font>

138
00:12:45,410 --> 00:12:48,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that I might just be
a replacement for nii-san.</font>

139
00:12:55,460 --> 00:12:58,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your older brother's your older brother.
And you are you.</font>

140
00:12:58,750 --> 00:13:02,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your father cares deeply
about you both.</font>

141
00:13:02,460 --> 00:13:04,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then why does he only think
about nii-san?!</font>

142
00:13:05,050 --> 00:13:07,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not it...</font>

143
00:13:07,260 --> 00:13:09,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your father has to protect
the Uchiha Clan</font>

144
00:13:09,970 --> 00:13:12,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">as a representative of the clan.</font>

145
00:13:13,060 --> 00:13:15,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about it?!</font>

146
00:13:15,230 --> 00:13:18,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Itachi is just bigger than you
and is your elder.</font>

147
00:13:18,730 --> 00:13:20,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll naturally be entrusted</font>

148
00:13:20,650 --> 00:13:23,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with that much more work
for the clan, right?</font>

149
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:26,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your father is the supervisor
of the work so...</font>

150
00:13:26,570 --> 00:13:31,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it might be that his eyes were
likely to go towards your older brother.</font>

151
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:40,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But this is just between us.</font>

152
00:13:41,250 --> 00:13:42,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When he's with me,</font>

153
00:13:42,590 --> 00:13:45,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">your father does nothing
but talk about you.</font>

154
00:13:50,260 --> 00:13:54,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's just always sullen
and awkward so...</font>

155
00:14:12,620 --> 00:14:15,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll catch up to nii-san no matter what!</font>

156
00:14:31,010 --> 00:14:32,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it...!</font>

157
00:14:37,940 --> 00:14:41,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-san's back is still
far out of reach.</font>

158
00:14:54,160 --> 00:14:57,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forgive me Sasuke...
Maybe another time.</font>

159
00:15:00,710 --> 00:15:02,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Clan... Clan...</font>

160
00:15:03,460 --> 00:15:07,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You measure incorrectly
the size of your own "vessels"</font>

161
00:15:07,210 --> 00:15:12,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and don't know the depth of mine
so you grovel there.</font>

162
00:15:18,180 --> 00:15:22,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My "vessel" is
dismayed at this foolish clan.</font>

163
00:15:23,610 --> 00:15:26,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I feel like... ever since that day</font>

164
00:15:26,440 --> 00:15:29,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he hasn't been the same
as he was before.</font>

165
00:15:37,040 --> 00:15:38,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-san...</font>

166
00:15:39,540 --> 00:15:42,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today when school's finished</font>

167
00:15:42,540 --> 00:15:44,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will you join me for
some Shuriken Jutsu training?</font>

168
00:15:45,420 --> 00:15:50,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm busy.
You should have Father teach you.</font>

169
00:15:51,090 --> 00:15:57,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But even I know that you're better
at Shuriken Jutsu than Father is.</font>

170
00:15:58,720 --> 00:16:02,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You always treat me like
a nuisance like that.</font>

171
00:16:16,580 --> 00:16:20,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Forgive me Sasuke.
Maybe next time...</font>

172
00:16:35,590 --> 00:16:38,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't have the time to
be dealing with you today.</font>

173
00:16:40,770 --> 00:16:45,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You always say "Forgive me Sasuke"
and poke me on the forehead.</font>

174
00:16:45,400 --> 00:16:48,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and you say "today"
but it never happens.</font>

175
00:16:52,820 --> 00:16:56,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank goodness...
he's the same as before.</font>

176
00:17:04,920 --> 00:17:06,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-san...</font>

177
00:17:12,380 --> 00:17:15,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His eyes looking back
at Father that time...</font>

178
00:17:18,260 --> 00:17:20,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It wasn't just an ordinary Sharingan...</font>

179
00:17:22,100 --> 00:17:23,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And...</font>

180
00:17:25,390 --> 00:17:26,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father...?</font>

181
00:17:26,560 --> 00:17:27,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm?</font>

182
00:17:28,060 --> 00:17:31,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are there several types
of Sharingan?</font>

183
00:17:31,730 --> 00:17:36,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh... You're already interested
in Sharingan?</font>

184
00:17:37,860 --> 00:17:40,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, it's still too soon for you.</font>

185
00:17:42,040 --> 00:17:44,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's totally different from
the Fire Style Jutsu.</font>

186
00:17:44,290 --> 00:17:46,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But someday I too...!</font>

187
00:17:46,620 --> 00:17:49,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all... I'm your kid so.</font>

188
00:17:52,670 --> 00:17:56,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed there is a Visual Jutsu
above the Sharingan</font>

189
00:17:56,760 --> 00:17:59,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Mangekyo Sharingan.</font>

190
00:17:59,470 --> 00:18:01,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mangekyo Sharingan...</font>

191
00:18:02,930 --> 00:18:05,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In the long history of the Uchiha</font>

192
00:18:05,230 --> 00:18:09,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's a legendary Visual Jutsu
that only a few develop.</font>

193
00:18:10,520 --> 00:18:15,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And it's said that it only opened
under a particular condition.</font>

194
00:18:18,610 --> 00:18:20,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A particular condition...?</font>

195
00:18:32,500 --> 00:18:34,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't chase after your
older brother anymore.</font>

196
00:18:35,710 --> 00:18:40,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder what he thinks of my
relationship with nii-san?</font>

197
00:18:42,600 --> 00:18:43,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father...</font>

198
00:18:44,640 --> 00:18:48,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why doesn't nii-san care about me?</font>

199
00:18:52,150 --> 00:18:54,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a bit peculiar...</font>

200
00:18:55,530 --> 00:18:58,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's a type of person who doesn't
care for making friends with people.</font>

201
00:18:59,990 --> 00:19:01,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?</font>

202
00:19:01,700 --> 00:19:03,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who knows...?</font>

203
00:19:03,910 --> 00:19:07,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even I, his father, can't read that boy.</font>

204
00:19:10,580 --> 00:19:14,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here I spoke because I wanted
more of nii-san's attention.</font>

205
00:19:14,960 --> 00:19:17,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Father isn't against it.</font>

206
00:19:18,220 --> 00:19:20,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here Sasuke!
Your box lunch.</font>

207
00:19:21,340 --> 00:19:25,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll watch your Shuriken practice
after you come home.</font>

208
00:19:26,720 --> 00:19:29,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not practice, it's training!</font>

209
00:19:30,350 --> 00:19:31,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm off!</font>

210
00:19:33,810 --> 00:19:35,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's good...</font>

211
00:19:35,570 --> 00:19:40,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not that Father dislikes
nii-san after all.</font>

212
00:19:43,370 --> 00:19:47,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nii-san graduated from the Academy
at the top of his class at age seven.</font>

213
00:19:47,120 --> 00:19:49,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He learned to use
the Sharingan at age eight.</font>

214
00:19:49,750 --> 00:19:52,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And he was promoted
to Chunin at age ten.</font>

215
00:19:52,540 --> 00:19:56,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I've got the same Uchiha blood
flowing inside me as he does.</font>

216
00:19:57,130 --> 00:19:58,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose to him!</font>

217
00:20:09,770 --> 00:20:13,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not gonna tell me this is
the best you can do, are you?</font>

218
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:17,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You boast about your Ninja Way
and this is all you've got?</font>

219
00:20:22,650 --> 00:20:25,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you still thinking that
I'm a member of your comrade game?</font>

220
00:20:29,080 --> 00:20:31,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that's the case you're...</font>

221
00:20:31,830 --> 00:20:33,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a hopeless fool!</font>

222
00:20:37,040 --> 00:20:38,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop wasting time!</font>

223
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:40,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give me all you've got</font>

224
00:20:40,670 --> 00:20:43,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you number one hyperactive
knucklehead Ninja!</font>

225
00:21:12,390 --> 00:21:17,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitotsu hitotsu omoidaseba</font></font></font></font>

226
00:21:12,390 --> 00:21:17,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">when I recalled the parts one by one,</font></font></font></font>

227
00:21:17,160 --> 00:21:23,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">subete wakatteita kigashite ita no ni</font></font></font></font>

228
00:21:17,160 --> 00:21:23,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I felt as though I had understood everything</font></font></font></font>

229
00:21:23,560 --> 00:21:27,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">iroaseta kotoba wa</font></font></font></font>

230
00:21:23,560 --> 00:21:27,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">faded words</font></font></font></font>

231
00:21:27,970 --> 00:21:34,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">boku no sugu soba ni oite atta</font></font></font></font>

232
00:21:27,970 --> 00:21:34,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">which I kept so close to me</font></font></font></font>

233
00:21:34,340 --> 00:21:39,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kotae no denai yoru to</font></font></font></font>

234
00:21:34,340 --> 00:21:39,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">speechless nights,</font></font></font></font>

235
00:21:39,920 --> 00:21:44,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">a hint of warmth,</font></font></font></font>

236
00:21:39,960 --> 00:21:44,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">hitokira no nukumori to</font></font></font></font>

237
00:21:45,670 --> 00:21:50,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">and this distant yearning for you</font></font></font></font>

238
00:21:45,720 --> 00:21:50,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">haruka kanata no akogare to</font></font></font></font>

239
00:21:51,140 --> 00:21:53,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I live,</font></font></font></font>

240
00:21:51,180 --> 00:21:53,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">tada sore dake wo</font></font></font></font>

241
00:21:53,970 --> 00:22:00,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">simply repeating this cycle</font></font></font></font>

242
00:21:54,020 --> 00:22:00,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kurikaeshi boku wa ikite iru</font></font></font></font>

243
00:22:02,110 --> 00:22:08,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">held in my two hands</font></font></font></font>

244
00:22:02,150 --> 00:22:08,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kono ryoute ni kakaete iru mono</font></font></font></font>

245
00:22:08,990 --> 00:22:11,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">a droplet of time</font></font></font></font>

246
00:22:09,030 --> 00:22:11,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">toki no shizuku</font></font></font></font>

247
00:22:13,030 --> 00:22:19,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">softly clutching forgotten memories</font></font></font></font>

248
00:22:13,080 --> 00:22:19,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">sotto nigirishimete wasureta kioku</font></font></font></font>

249
00:22:19,370 --> 00:22:22,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">lost words</font></font></font></font>

250
00:22:19,420 --> 00:22:22,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">nakushita kotoba</font></font></font></font>

251
00:22:31,140 --> 00:22:35,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">I'll keep these thoughts...</font></font></font></font>

252
00:22:31,180 --> 00:22:35,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="24"><font face="Wolf Sans"><font color="#f5ebff">kono omoi wa</font></font></font></font>

253
00:22:38,960 --> 00:22:40,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Just as Neji said,</font>

254
00:22:40,540 --> 00:22:43,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">it seems Sasuke's in
the darkness right now.</font>

255
00:22:43,420 --> 00:22:44,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Damn it.</font>

256
00:22:44,840 --> 00:22:46,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">He really did hit me with all his might.</font>

257
00:22:47,380 --> 00:22:52,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Hey Sasuke, am I not your comrade
or anything anymore?!</font>

258
00:22:52,800 --> 00:22:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Don't all those things we
did together in Team 7</font>

259
00:22:56,930 --> 00:22:59,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">mean anything to you?!</font>

260
00:22:59,900 --> 00:23:03,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next episode
"Enlightenment, The Secret of the Mangekyou Sharingan."</font>

